          "text": "Témoignages: [AERO 2XRYR, RAM, EIN] BORDEAUX (33) 14.04.2010",
          "text_sha256": "ef4a942aa01193fb4bb6b53b0281d0b11ef651aa3840739c618d758ab1ee8bc4"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
